# Issue #13: 10-minute internet outage on the Pi, 2026-11-20 UTC (gwmon 2.1.0 live, publish every 300 s).
# Method: gwmon/test/pi-outage-test.sh 600, detached with setsid: deletes the default route; the LAN route stays.
# The default route came back at about 22:49:00-22:49:05 (udhcpc lease renewal, before the script's 600 s were up):
# the outage lasted 9 min 36 s to 9 min 41 s. The script's own route count shows it from 22:49:05 ('2 default route(s)': busybox
